## To be installed outside of the app bundle

### Unversioned AND Versioned installs

 - ~/.local/share/applications/$APPLICATION[-$APPVERSION].desktop
 
 - ~/.local/bin/app_n[-$APPVERSION] foreach app_n in appinfo.BINLINKS
 
### Unversioned only

 - ~/.local/share/mime/packages/$APPLICATION.xml
 
 - files in ~/.local/share/icons (need to search for them in the source).

